And you were interested in resume for such a young person.
对于这么年轻的人来说，你的履历……

00:44:38.577 --> 00:44:39.298
Yeah, you do.
是的，确实如此。

00:44:39.298 --> 00:44:40.907
Yeah, you do, you do, you do.
对，没错，确实是这样。

